1106 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Amity University\054 Dubai \055 Web Developer \05003\0572023 \055 08\0572026\051 \n \nManaging the university website\054 which includes regular content updates and front\055end development as per the organisation\047s strategic goals\056\240\nSound knowledge of Figma and Adobe Suite for editing\054 resizing and creative design for the website\056\nIntegrating website forms with CRM platform\054 addressing related user issues\054 and conducting API testing\056\nImplementing automation on the website and CRM platform to boost the conversion efficiency of the admissions team\056\nUse of Google Analytics 4 \050GA4\051 reports to enhance website performance\056\nUpdating the website with SEO recommendations on a monthly basis\056\240\nCollaborating with the Digital Marketing Team on GTM code for tracking\054 landing pages\054 and form updates\054 including API testing and CRM integration\056\nDeveloping and setting up conference and event websites\054 as part of the university\047s outreach initiatives\056\nConnecting with internal and external stakeholders for timely website updates\056\n\nDieutek Developments\054 Kochi \055 React \055 Laravel Developer \05009\0572022 \055 03\0572023\051\n \nFormulated tool to store company domain and server records thereby boosting employee efficiency\056\nDesigned in Figma created Front end with React and Tailwind\056 Developed back end APIS with Laravel\056\nIntroduced middleware for authorised users to access permitted records\056\n \nOutclass\054 Bangalore \055 UI Developer \05007\0572019 \055 08\0572020\051\n \nKey role in developing UI for a new age Ed\056Tech platform to enable easier content access\054 self learning and evaluation mechanism\056 AI driven learning gap identification and improvement\056\nCollaborated with UX design team to convert designs in Adobe XD and Figma to code in Html5\054 Css3\054 ReactJS\056 \nAttained a product with responsive design for different screen types and sizes\056 \nRevamped designs in Figma to incorporate additional client requirements and coordinated with backend team for integration of APIs in MySQL with Frontend UI\056 \nDaily code maintenance and debugging\054 leveraged Git to commit code and updated JIRA tracker regularly\056\n \nFreelancer\054 Bangalore \055 Content Writer \05006\0572017 \055 06\0572019\051\n\nConceived research based technical content for online and in print platforms\056 \nExpedited the crafting and editing of high quality\054 visually appealing content with a captivating and authentic approach for Metro Mart Magazine\054 Kerala\056 Wrote SEO keyword optimised content for client websites to maximize user revisits\056 \n\nInfosys\054 Bangalore \055 Systems Engineer \05007\0572014 \055 03\0572016\051 \n\nBuilt Run book Automation tool for client Goldman Sachs as part of a 5 member team\056\nDeveloped and launched this tool to automate various workflows in order to minimise human intervention\056 Relevant actions in the workflow were stitched together to perform certain executable tasks in the run books\056\nCreated the front end user interface with Angular JS\054 Html5 and Css3 and utilized Java and MongoDb as the backbone technologies for the back\055end\056\nEmployed a blend of Agile scrum methodology to construct this real\055time system\054 specifically designed for implementation within the banking industry\056 )
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1107 0 R
     /Pg 1090 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
